      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td><code>app.scan.packages</code> property placeholder to be resolved against the <code>Environment</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>需根据<code>Environment</code>解析<code>app.scan.packages</code>属性占位符</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
